  "Spillesteder, teatre, biblioteker, kulturhuse og foreninger i Aarhus, hvis arrangementer du finder på Socialklubben – med deres faste tilbud og kommende arrangementer.": "Music venues, theatres, libraries, cultural centres and associations in Aarhus whose events you'll find on Socialklubben – with their regular activities and upcoming events.",
  "Vil I være med?": "Would you like to be included?",
